NOTE ON BUNDLED GAME DATA

This repository may bundle vanilla `.msb.dcx` map files extracted from a
licensed Elden Ring Nightreign installation. Those files are FromSoftware's
copyrighted game data, NOT covered by the MIT license above. They are
included here as a convenience for users who already own Nightreign, under
the standard mod-scene understanding that redistributing game data alongside
mod tooling is tolerated for the purpose of enabling that tooling to work.

If you do not own a licensed copy of Elden Ring Nightreign, you do not have
permission to use the bundled `.msb.dcx` files. Delete `vanilla_msbs/` and
point the rando at your own NR install via the GUI's Folders section.

The MIT license covers the rando engine, GUI, data catalogs (JSON), patched
EMEVDs, and other authored content in this repository. Bundled game data is
specifically excluded from the MIT grant.
